  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adressing education and skills Gaps for Vulnerable Youths in Haiti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.3	Development Objective
The project&#x2019;s development objective is to address Education and Qualification Gaps for Vulnerable Youths in Haiti in promoting rural socio-economic development in South and Grande Anse Departments.
1.4	Immediate Objectives
The project will have five immediate objectives
Immediate objective 1: Institutional capacity of two professional training centres in Grande Anse and South is strengthened. 
